{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56417","headline":"山居（七言） · 戴光乂","name":"山居（七言）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"犁锄阔地烧侵云，焰猛冲岩迸鹿羣。\n鼙鼓静时长霸国，战争无事感明君。\n啼猿响树寒山碧，宿鸟喧巢夜雾曛。\n梯嶮上岩缘路去，院僧敲磬晓来闻。\n（见宋桑世昌《回文类聚》卷三。\n）（按：徐松《登科记考》卷二十七引《永乐大典》引《宜春志》，袁州进士及第者有戴光义，及第年代不详。\n光义当即光乂，未详以孰爲正。\n《宋史·艺文志》七着录「戴文〖一作『乂』〗《回文诗》一卷」，戴文或戴乂，均爲戴光乂之误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴光乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56417.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56417","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}